*.tsbuildinfo
# Gitignored, but not build-context-ignored until now: the `build` stage's
# `COPY . .` copies the host's working directory verbatim, which silently
# overwrote the `deps` stage's freshly `prisma generate`d client with
# whatever stale copy happened to sit on the builder's disk (e.g. from an
# earlier local `npm run build` predating a schema change) — a build that
# succeeds and ships a Prisma Client out of sync with the schema/source
# it was actually built against, non-reproducibly depending on the
# builder's local state. `prisma generate`'s own output, always, never a
# leftover from the host.
src/generated
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
prisma/*.db
prisma/*.db-journal
